+        Else:
+        $$ shadow = 1.0 $$
+    e.  **Final Color**:
+        $$ lightColor = shadow \times \max(intensity \times diffuse + spec, ambient) $$
+        where $diffuse = 0.6$ and $ambient = 0.4$ [S1, unofficial].
+        $$ finalColor = voxelColor.rgb \times lightColor $$
