+6.  **Soft Shadow Calculation**:
+    Sample 8 points around $p$ in a 3x3 grid (excluding center) with spacing:
+    $$ delta = \min(voxelSize.x, \min(voxelSize.y, voxelSize.z)) \times 2.0 $$
